transcript:
Micro-interactions are the polish that makes a website feel expensive and premium.
The Magnetic Button: When the cursor moves within 50px of a CTA button, the button translates toward the cursor:
const x = (e.clientX - rect.left - rect.width / 2) * 0.35;
const y = (e.clientY - rect.top - rect.height / 2) * 0.35;
button.style.transform = `translate(${x}px, ${y}px)`;
When the mouse leaves, animate it back to (0,0) with an elastic spring easing.
Hover card glare: Add a dynamic radial-gradient highlight overlay on project cards that tracks the mouse position across the card surface.
